{"id":2749,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>3月13日下午，我院与数学学院在11105H教室联合举办华彩讲坛。本次讲坛由中北大学马克思主义学院范俊丽副教授主讲，我院研一研二学生参加。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MLlLo4M7-YUl-iLu87iM4n7MRUaLmCUbozU4oRN4nzUYoRL0gihFp2hmCIa0LSh2LSyYMkh2UNMVUm9bMzCin7V7o7r7ozNYL7UiMzLPo7nFUNn7nlQ2MmAFM7Q7LR9Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C8LmlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6425&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1F124FBCEB89565DAD8ED9920D55318D/BDDEFF68/4FD08\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 642px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MU8Lo4LRG8LmW7Lu7CPMmrRMRUZMNWU7UzTRnl-8L8-4olL0gihFp2hmCIa0oShfUSysn1yZL4UiUmW2MNrkLz-4UmTkUN-YM4vYMzMko7nFLzVfUlr2LmQFMzn7MmT2gtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDMR-igtA8pUncc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6425&e=.jpg\"></p><p>范教授聚焦大学生高频法律风险场景，围绕实习就业合规、校园消费纠纷、个人信息保护等青年关切问题展开深入讲解。她结合“招转培与培训贷”求职陷阱、“免考包过”考证骗局、网购货不对板及人脸信息泄露等典型案例，系统剖析法律风险，梳理维权路径，将抽象法条转化为实用指南，帮助学生在具体情境中识别风险。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MnRMokU4liMz7YUuzU8nNlYMlCYU8CUDUzvbn7QkUm-PoRN0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyYUShRUShkLllYMNQVMmUZMm67UmLaL4lDLmnRUmTkMz6FUlUYU49iozrFLN7ZM77Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C8LmlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6425&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/42ACAB1E26FE64867DB3035624CB9B57/AD2C8595/2A84A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 647px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MLlLoDnlM2LzvZnumQVLmVkol-ZU4NUYL47iUlLPL4CiUmG0gihFp2hmCIa0nkybLkyZUSyiM8UaUz-sM4C8L7nRL8QRnzQfLmWknzC4L4QFL4lYL7LbnmVFUzM2ollJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C8LmlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6425&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次讲坛是推动法治教育进校园，加强青年法治观念的一次生动实践。通过以案释法、以法育人，帮助同学们提升了法律风险防范意识与自我保护能力，引导广大青年在法治护航下坚定理想信念、锤炼过硬本领、实现全面发展。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MLlLo4M7-YUl-iLu87iM4n7MRUaLmCUbozU4oRN4nzUYoRL0gihFp2hmCIa0LSh2LSyYMkh2UNMVUm9bMzCin7V7o7r7ozNYL7UiMzLPo7nFUNn7nlQ2MmAFM7Q7LR9Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4C8LmlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6425&e=.jpg"}